# nemotron-3.5-lightning on a Mac: llama.cpp with Metal, Q8_0, 64 GB of memory or more.
#
# 1 FIT     33.6 GB file; KV is 52 KiB a token (most layers are Mamba, with no KV),
#           6.8 GB at 131072 tokens. A 64 GB Mac lets the GPU wire about 48 GB:
#           it fits, up to about 251k tokens. On a 32 or 48 GB Mac,
#           NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B-A3B-Q4_0.gguf (18.9 GB) in the same repo.
WEIGHTS_GB=33.6
# 2 ENGINE  llama.cpp at rack's pinned build, Metal.
ENGINE=llamacpp
# 3 ACCESS  ggml-org's conversion, pinned.
. "$RECIPE_DIR/model.env"
ARTIFACT=ggml-org/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B-A3B-GGUF/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B-A3B-Q8_0.gguf
ARTIFACT_REVISION=8a08a1c81dadcc75d35dbb96016cfd344b632e67
SERVE_ARGS=(
  # 4 SHAPE
  --n-gpu-layers 999
  --ctx-size 131072              # 64 GB Mac; 262144 (the model's window) from 96 GB
  # 5 DIALECT
  --jinja
  --reasoning-format deepseek    # <think> spans become reasoning_content
)
ENV_EXTRA=()
# 8 PROOF   not yet benched here: rack up nemotron-3.5-lightning --mac && rack bench nemotron-3.5-lightning-mac
